  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt. Stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65404ab47ab5c897ad152327-85ffd6aa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Cut bamboo shoots (see ingredients) into bite-sized chunks.\n• Thinly slice red onion.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65404ab47ab5c897ad152327-a33dbb79.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch half of the sliced onion in your hands, then add it to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65404ab47ab5c897ad152327-37ba6304.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65404ab47ab5c897ad152327-a2acd0b8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot, bamboo shoots and the remaining onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add the remaining garlic and mild Thai red curry paste (see ingredients) and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add coconut milk, the water (for the curry), soy sauce, brown sugar and tofu and simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65404ab47ab5c897ad152327-72920fd3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain the pickled onion.\n• Divide garlic rice between bowls and spoon over Thai-style tofu and veggie red curry.\n• Top with pickled onion, a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt and crushed peanuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65404ab47ab5c897ad152327-e784cd17.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
